  "question": {
    "text": "A galvanometer having coil resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> shows a full scale deflection for a current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mA</mi></math>. For it to measure a current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, the value of the shunt should be:"
  },
